## SQ-CM-01
@group any
@commands latest.log: `[itemMerges] creativedelight` prints 49 merges on the full pack (baseline 2026-11-23, the sum of the 18 swaps merges_*.json lists; the old "3 higher than before" half is dropped, no pre-cantaloupe count is kept), no script error from `fruitsdelight/item_merges.js`, `veggies_foods.js`, `canning.js`; no loaded recipe makes `creativeengineering:canned_hamimelon` or `fruitsdelight:hamimelon_popsicle` or takes `fruitsdelight:hamimelon_slice`
@pass Existing test: MG-39
@reviewed 2026-11-23
shell grep -hE "\[itemMerges\] creativedelight" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | tail -3; grep -hiE "(item_merges|veggies_foods|canning)\.js.*(error|exception)" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | head -5; true
