## CQ-CM-37 | Polymorph: one wood's slabs offer its composter first, then vanilla's; mixed slabs and a lone wood composter give vanilla's
@group client
@commands crafting table, survival: 7 spruce slabs in the composter shape (Polymorph button), pick each; 7 oak slabs; 4 spruce + 3 birch slabs; a Spruce Composter alone in the grid
@pass spruce slabs: the Polymorph list shows Spruce Composter first, then Composter, and each can be taken; oak slabs and mixed slabs: Composter only (no button); a Spruce Composter alone: Composter
@fails Polymorph orders by translation key (`block.creativedelight.*` before `block.minecraft.*`, R20); a recipe that also matched mixed slabs
@draft crafting-grid and Polymorph-widget clicks: the first runner writes the driver steps (`click_widget`) or keeps it a hand check
## CQ-CM-42 | look: the 12 composters in the world (empty, filling, ready) and WTHIT's level line
@group client
@commands platform at 0 100 0, the 12 wood composters and vanilla's in a row at level 0, a second row at level 4, a third at level 8; shots; WTHIT on a level-4 one
@pass LOOK: each composter shows its own wood (palette swaps of vanilla's composter, R8) on the side, top and bottom, the vanilla compost fill at level 4 and the ready texture at 8; WTHIT shows the level line on a wood composter
@fails textures `assets/creativedelight/textures/block/<wood>_composter_{side,top,bottom}.png` (sources.csv rows); models parent vanilla's composter; WTHIT registers on the `ComposterBlock` class
@absent creativedelight:spruce_composter creativedelight:birch_composter creativedelight:dark_oak_composter creativedelight:jungle_composter creativedelight:acacia_composter creativedelight:mangrove_composter creativedelight:twisted_composter creativedelight:ancient_composter creativedelight:blossom_composter creativedelight:azalea_composter creativedelight:crimson_composter creativedelight:warped_composter creativedelight:composters (registered or tagged by the Creative Common jar of 2026-11-21, after the last /dumpall)
