@@title SQ-CM wave 2 carve: composters moved to Creative Delight, old ids swapped, 2026-11-24 ([composting.md](../composting.md) 3; [plan_wave2_publish.md](../plan_wave2_publish.md) W2-9; TODO `creative-common-publish #18`)
@@date 2026-11-24
@@jars creativecommon creativecompat creativedelight
@@sources feature_writeup/composting.md development/creativeDelight/src/main/java/com/SaintAlfonzo/creativedelight/farm/composter development/creativeDelight/src/main/resources/data/creativedelight/swaps/common_composters.json kubejs/data/creativedelight/kubejs/creativedelight/composters.js
@@text The 12 wood composters are `creativedelight:<wood>_composter` since 2026-11-24; Delight's swap list `common_composters.json` maps each old `creativecommon:` id. An old-id save must be made fresh with the jars from before the carve (agent note forge-missing-mappings-staging.md: a world opened once without the remap loses the old ids from level.dat).
@@table
## SQ-CM-42 | old save: composters placed, in a chest and in an inventory with the Common ids come back as Delight's
@group B (old-id save fixture)
@commands boot 1 with the Creative Common and Creative Delight jars from before the carve (`jar_archive/displaced/`, stamp 16c9e8ace or older): place `creativecommon:spruce_composter[level=4]` and `creativecommon:crimson_composter`, put 2 `creativecommon:birch_composter` in a chest and 1 in a bot's inventory; stop; swap in the current jars; boot 2; read the blocks, the chest and the inventory
@pass boot 2: the blocks are `creativedelight:spruce_composter[level=4]` and `creativedelight:crimson_composter`; the chest holds 2 `creativedelight:birch_composter`, the bot 1; latest.log has the swap lines for the composter ids and no `Missing` / `unknown` line naming `creativecommon:*_composter`
@fails `data/creativedelight/swaps/common_composters.json` not read (SwapLists, Delight jar); the remap resolved in the STAGING registry (agent note forge-missing-mappings-staging.md); the save opened once without the new jars
@draft the runner writes the two-boot jar swap as `@@prep boot=2: run` lines (old jars from `jar_archive/displaced/`)
@modset none
## SQ-CM-43 | composters and their recipes, tags and loot under Delight's namespace; no Common composter left
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest makes creativedelight:spruce_composter`; `/cdevtest tag item creativedelight:composters`; `/cdevtest tag item creativecommon:composters`; `/cdevtest tag item creativecompat:floats` (or the item physics floats tag the Compat script fills); `/give @s creativecommon:spruce_composter`; grep latest.log for `composter`
@pass the recipe is from 7 spruce slabs; `creativedelight:composters` has 13 entries; `creativecommon:composters` is empty or absent; the floats tag holds the 12 wood composters; the Common id is an unknown item; no ERROR line naming a composter id or `#creativedelight:composters`
@fails `kubejs/data/creativedelight/kubejs/creativedelight/composters.js` not in the Delight jar; `item_dict.js` keys still naming `creativecommon:`; Compat's `item_physics_tags.js` guard (`global.has('creativedelight')`)
@draft steps from SQ-CM-37 with the new namespace; the floats tag name is read from `item_physics_tags.js` `PHYSICS_TAG`
@absent creativedelight:spruce_composter creativedelight:composters (moved 2026-11-24, after the last /dumpall)
@modset none
